+ * in as `footprint`, in leg lengths from the hips and off the floor, and each
+ * sample is solved onto this rig's legs with the same IK the runtime plant
+ * uses. Contacts get the extra constraint that makes them contacts: the ball
+ * of the foot is held high enough that the front of the shoe rests on the
+ * floor rather than through it.
+ *
