+
+/**
+ * Where this rig's floor is, in its own space.
+ *
+ * Nominally zero, and close enough to it on every avatar measured - but a rig
+ * exported half a centimetre into the ground would otherwise have every stance
+ * in every clip baked half a centimetre into the ground with it.
+ */
